---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { envOf } from '../lib/db';

const env = await envOf();
---

<BaseLayout title="关于" description={`关于「${env.SITE_NAME}」`}>
  <div class="page-hero">
    <a class="page-back reveal in" href="/">← 回到卷首</a>
    <div class="page-hero-card reveal in">
      <p class="character-kicker">跋</p>
      <h1>关于此间</h1>
      <p class="lead">{env.SITE_SLOGAN}</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <article class="article">
    <div class="article-body reveal in">
      <p>
        吾名江逐月，亦可称吾江榫。闲散时，多提笔勾勒三两闲言，望各位客官看个尽兴。
      </p>
      <blockquote>希君生羽翼，一化北溟鱼。</blockquote>
      <p>
        如若相谈，可联系 <a href="mailto:3287047638@qq.com">3287047638@qq.com</a>。
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>